ChatGPT Web worker — AGPL-3.0-only

This worker contains protocol adaptations of yukkcat/chatgpt2api by yukkcat and
its contributors, pinned to commit 4336d0594dd4fe2962bca5b0b55bc95a24686e59.
Upstream repository: https://github.com/yukkcat/chatgpt2api
The complete upstream GNU Affero General Public License version 3 is preserved
verbatim in LICENSE; this worker uses AGPL-3.0-only, not “or later”.

Adapted files are identified in their headers and PROVENANCE.md. Worker-specific
HTTP authentication, validation, transport restrictions, SQLite submission fence,
cache and tests are new implementation work. All original upstream application
UI/account/database services and executable challenge VM are excluded.
No upstream copyright notices were removed from adapted excerpts; the referenced
source modules have no additional file-level copyright notice.

Changes dated 2026-11-12: isolate one supplied account and exit, bound input,
output and CPU, reject unsupported challenges, prohibit generation replays,
remove credential/account mutation and fallback, add durable private state,
strict output trust and SSRF controls, and replace external integration tests
with mock-only tests. No live verification has occurred.

